    "summary": "All three KDE autotest suites passed. KCodecs then failed at dpkg-gensymbols against the older Ubuntu 6.24 baseline; KDBusAddons and ThreadWeaver built successfully but the SupraLINUX contract checker did not normalize dpkg-deb's 'Multi-Arch: no' to the reference snapshot's null representation. Lintian also exposed the missing watch signing key and a Standards-Version declaration newer than Resolute's policy baseline."
